WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.917
Quotes costed by hand in Excel. Orders lost in email. Payments chased by phone. Sound familiar?

2
00:00:06.597 --> 00:00:11.498
Meet Astra Trade. One app for your trading business, from the first email to the money in the bank.

3
00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:16.251
A customer's email or WhatsApp becomes an inquiry, ready in about a minute.

4
00:00:16.931 --> 00:00:23.394
Astra reads every line, the standard, grade, size, and quantity, and only asks you about what's unclear.

5
00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:29.223
Each line is priced from today's metal prices, exchange rates, and your margins, in seconds.

6
00:00:29.903 --> 00:00:33.035
Your director approves the quote in one click, even from a phone.

7
00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:39.537
The reply waits in your own mailbox, with the PDF and Excel attached. Nothing goes out until you press Send.

8
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:45.138
Every deal is one clear journey, from inquiry to payment, and you always see who it's waiting on.

9
00:00:45.818 --> 00:00:50.965
Orders move from the mill, to production, to shipping, with value and tonnes at every step.

10
00:00:51.645 --> 00:00:55.431
Metal prices and exchange rates are updated every day, in one place.

11
00:00:56.111 --> 00:01:00.101
Bills of lading and mill certificates are read for you. You just check and confirm.

12
00:01:00.781 --> 00:01:05.337
Bank payments are matched to invoices, and reminders for late payers are ready in one click.

13
00:01:06.016 --> 00:01:09.907
Letters of credit are checked against shipping dates, documents, and amounts.

14
00:01:10.587 --> 00:01:13.828
Claims go from complaint to credit note, with the mill's share worked out.

15
00:01:14.508 --> 00:01:18.428
Win and loss, forecast, profit, and money owed to you, all live.

16
00:01:19.108 --> 00:01:23.876
Trade in euros, dollars, pounds, or rupees, across all your companies.

17
00:01:24.556 --> 00:01:28.650
Astra Trade. Your trading business, made simple. Book a free demo today.
